content.text:
Saved and verified. I walked every page of `/v3/audit-events` via the Link `rel="next"` header (pages 1→2→3, stopping when page 3 returned no `link` header), disambiguating the dev-A `geofence_exit` events from the dev-C `geofence_exit` (page 1) and the dev-B `low_battery` (page 2) traps. The feed's canonical dev-A geofence-exit marker was consistent across all pages and is now stored in `local:dev_a_geofence_exit_marker` for the reconcile job.

```json
{
  "dev_a_geofence_exit_marker": "dvA-gx-3"
}
```
